WEBVTT

00:01.300 --> 00:03.810
Haruto, be careful on your journey.

00:03.810 --> 00:05.890
Yeah, I'll be fine.

00:05.890 --> 00:09.150
Did you hide Liza's horns and tail?

00:09.150 --> 00:11.420
She seems a bit uneasy about it.

00:11.420 --> 00:14.740
Well, it might take her 
some time to get used to.

00:15.310 --> 00:16.440
Why?!

00:16.440 --> 00:18.780
There, there.

00:16.740 --> 00:18.780
Why is it Liza?!

00:19.060 --> 00:22.380
Haruto, evil will never prosper!

00:22.380 --> 00:23.870
Please do your best!

00:23.870 --> 00:26.280
Y-Yeah, I'll try.

00:45.480 --> 00:48.860
<b>Am I Actually the Strongest?</b>

01:57.380 --> 02:02.350
Episode 8

01:57.380 --> 02:02.350
<b>A New Encounter</b>

01:57.560 --> 02:03.560
m 0 0 l 50 0 l 45 13 l -5 13

02:00.820 --> 02:02.100
Laius!

02:02.100 --> 02:02.810
Hey!

02:02.810 --> 02:04.900
Don't just barge in like that, idiot!

02:05.270 --> 02:06.580
Look at this!

02:06.580 --> 02:09.140
I've received a letter from the margrave!

02:09.510 --> 02:13.010
I bet it just says that Haruto 
set off for the royal capital.

02:13.010 --> 02:15.830
You don't need to come all this 
way just to tell me that.

02:15.830 --> 02:20.100
I worked hard on this because <i>you</i> wanted 
a recommendation letter for Haruto!

02:20.390 --> 02:23.120
You have a reason for going 
that far, isn't there?

02:23.900 --> 02:27.080
I want to know why he's so strong.

02:27.080 --> 02:30.920
I've been fiercely honing my magic 
and swordsmanship skills since then.

02:30.920 --> 02:34.800
But as I do, it feels like he only 
moves further from my grasp.

02:35.130 --> 02:39.640
But if we went to the same school, 
I could learn more about him up close.

02:39.640 --> 02:41.250
That's all there is to it.

02:41.250 --> 02:44.860
I see, so you've been 
changed by your defeat.

02:44.860 --> 02:47.730
Although, you're still as cocky as ever.

02:48.140 --> 02:50.080
What about you, Marianne?

02:50.080 --> 02:52.180
I hear you stood up to Father.

02:52.430 --> 02:56.180
Saying you wouldn't budge until 
you got the recommendation

02:56.180 --> 02:57.680
and refusing to leave your room.

02:57.080 --> 02:57.680
What?!

02:58.020 --> 02:59.570
Who told you that?!

02:59.570 --> 03:02.020
I heard the guards talking about it.

03:02.320 --> 03:06.500
Sounds like you're more 
obsessed with him than I am!

03:06.500 --> 03:10.900
I-It's not like I bear feelings 
for Haruto or anything!

03:10.900 --> 03:11.310
Eh?

03:11.310 --> 03:11.840
Eh?

03:12.620 --> 03:17.550
N-No, I wasn't really talking 
about love or anything there.

03:18.490 --> 03:20.750
Wait, could it be...

03:20.750 --> 03:22.920
Th-That's not it!

03:26.740 --> 03:29.450
But I hear you've had it hard lately.

03:29.450 --> 03:33.530
With those weird cultists throwing
 their weight around at the school?

03:34.390 --> 03:37.040
You knew about that?

03:37.680 --> 03:40.500
Yes, the Church of Lucifyra.

03:40.500 --> 03:44.920
A new cult disguised as a branch of the 
state religion, the Church of Mija.

03:45.320 --> 03:49.350
They espouse extremist ideologies 
and are said to worship a demon.

03:49.870 --> 03:51.760
I hear that it's not just the academy,

03:51.760 --> 03:55.330
but that their influence is 
spreading throughout the kingdom.

03:55.950 --> 03:58.910
And they pose one more problem.

03:59.310 --> 04:04.540
As of late, it seems some of them bring 
up the idea of overthrowing the monarchy.

04:04.850 --> 04:08.520
Despite this, there are increasing cases 
of aristocrats joining their ranks,

04:08.520 --> 04:11.270
giving them additional sources of funding...

04:11.710 --> 04:15.450
There are rumors that Mother 
is the source of that funding.

04:16.380 --> 04:21.730
I don't understand what Mother 
is trying to accomplish.

04:22.230 --> 04:25.430
She suddenly changed five years ago.

04:25.430 --> 04:27.590
What happened, exactly?

04:27.590 --> 04:31.040
Who placed that collar on her neck?

04:31.040 --> 04:33.050
She won't tell even me.

04:33.910 --> 04:37.790
To be perfectly honest, I'm scared of her.

04:38.540 --> 04:42.070
I always knew she was a ruthless person,

04:42.070 --> 04:45.180
but I get the feeling it's 
only become more extreme.

04:45.390 --> 04:49.090
By now, the entire kingdom knows that the 
king and queen consort are on bad terms.

04:49.420 --> 04:53.850
It wouldn't be strange for the 
Church of Lucifyra to try and use that.

04:54.180 --> 04:56.550
I didn't want to consider the idea,

04:56.980 --> 05:01.910
but could it be that Mother is out 
to crush Father with all she's got?

05:03.330 --> 05:06.260
What in the world are we supposed to do?

05:07.760 --> 05:10.240
This may be selfish of me...

05:10.900 --> 05:16.240
But I think that Haruto might be the 
one who can change this situation.

05:16.240 --> 05:18.000
Huh? Haruto?

05:18.000 --> 05:19.710
That seems a bit much.

05:20.090 --> 05:21.750
Yes, however...

05:22.220 --> 05:24.420
I can't help but place my faith in him.

05:24.920 --> 05:27.550
His powers are beyond measure.

05:27.550 --> 05:33.130
Perhaps he has the power to topple 
even an entire organization.

05:33.130 --> 05:35.030
You'd go that far?

05:35.720 --> 05:38.970
On that topic, I've heard that 
in Margrave Zenfis's province,

05:38.970 --> 05:42.530
there's a hero of justice 
called the Black Knight.

05:42.860 --> 05:46.480
Talented enough to defeat a dragon, at that.

05:46.480 --> 05:47.880
A dragon?!

05:47.880 --> 05:52.000
If we asked him for help, the situation might 
resolve itself surprisingly quickly.

05:52.000 --> 05:55.570
Oh, what a lively conversation 
you two are having.

05:55.570 --> 05:57.530
M-Mother?!

05:58.840 --> 06:02.610
L-Long time no see, Mother.

06:02.610 --> 06:04.400
Yes, Marianne.

06:04.400 --> 06:08.710
You grow lovelier every time I see you, 
just like the former queen consort.

06:09.060 --> 06:11.220
Th-Thank you very m—

06:13.470 --> 06:15.020
Wh-What are you...

06:15.540 --> 06:18.140
Where were you looking just now?

06:18.330 --> 06:21.020
It was this collar, wasn't it?

06:21.300 --> 06:25.470
Do you find it funny? Pitiful? Shameful?

06:25.470 --> 06:28.850
Are you ridiculing me like the rest?!

06:28.850 --> 06:31.030
No... Please...

06:32.820 --> 06:34.990
Mother! Please stop this!

06:40.330 --> 06:41.750
I'm just kidding.

06:41.750 --> 06:43.550
Nothing more than a joke.

06:43.550 --> 06:44.840
Marianne.

06:44.840 --> 06:47.410
Staring so brazenly is unbecoming of a lady.

06:47.410 --> 06:48.930
Do be careful.

06:49.700 --> 06:54.640
By the way, I hear you'll be attending the 
same school as Margrave Zenfis's son.

06:55.050 --> 06:57.250
I wasn't eavesdropping. Oh, no.

06:57.250 --> 06:59.010
I just happened to overhear it.

06:59.980 --> 07:03.380
He's coming here from the remote outskirts,

07:03.380 --> 07:06.340
so I'm sure he'll feel terribly alone.

07:06.340 --> 07:08.440
Do get along with him, won't you?

07:11.630 --> 07:16.990
Learn everything you can about the 
Black Knight from that brat.

07:16.990 --> 07:19.980
And don't tell a soul about it.

07:19.980 --> 07:22.670
What you learn is for my ears alone.

07:23.570 --> 07:26.330
You're my son, after all.

07:26.330 --> 07:28.600
That much should be simple, yes?

07:32.500 --> 07:33.560
Where's your response?

07:35.010 --> 07:37.760
Y-Yes, Mother.

07:52.670 --> 07:58.410
<i>Have I gotten Haruto involved 
in something terrible?</i>

07:59.290 --> 08:00.830
<i>Sorry, Haruto.</i>

08:02.260 --> 08:03.290
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

08:07.740 --> 08:11.670
Haruto, shouldn't you head 
over to the capital soon?

08:12.020 --> 08:14.400
Has it been that long already?

08:16.340 --> 08:19.670
<i>Actually, once we had lost 
sight of the castle,</i>

08:19.670 --> 08:21.970
<i>we turned around to come back 
here, carriage and all.</i>

08:21.970 --> 08:25.700
<i>I already installed a door near 
the capital a few days ago,</i>

08:25.700 --> 08:29.180
<i>so I've been taking it easy here until 
the day I was scheduled to arrive.</i>

08:31.440 --> 08:32.660
Lord Haruto!

08:32.660 --> 08:33.700
Please!

08:33.700 --> 08:35.420
Please reconsider one more time!

08:35.420 --> 08:36.240
Enough already!

08:39.750 --> 08:43.500
Flay, we have our own business to attend to.

08:43.500 --> 08:45.720
For now, let's just focus on that.

08:46.910 --> 08:48.960
Still... Still!

08:49.310 --> 08:51.590
Please leave this place to me.

08:51.590 --> 08:55.220
Haruto, go and accomplish 
your duties in the capital!

08:55.220 --> 08:57.730
S-Sure. Got it.

09:01.630 --> 09:03.030
Take care!

09:03.030 --> 09:05.410
Okay, I'm going now.

09:12.170 --> 09:14.150
Lord Haruto, where are we?

09:14.150 --> 09:15.990
A forest near the capital.

09:15.990 --> 09:18.990
This was the only place 
I could hide the door.

09:25.990 --> 09:28.150
It's still a ways off.

09:28.150 --> 09:30.580
That said, we'd be spotted if we flew there.

09:30.580 --> 09:32.580
Well, guess we're walking.

09:33.520 --> 09:35.210
Lord Haruto, over there.

09:38.990 --> 09:40.020
What <i>is</i> that?

09:40.020 --> 09:41.930
An Evil Bison, perhaps.

09:41.930 --> 09:44.150
They're not common around here,

09:44.150 --> 09:46.170
so maybe this one strayed from its herd?

09:46.170 --> 09:49.830
It's probably attacking 
humans because it's hungry.

09:49.830 --> 09:50.960
Seriously?

09:50.960 --> 09:52.860
I thought bison were herbivores.

09:53.320 --> 09:55.410
<i>I could ignore them,</i>

09:55.410 --> 09:58.640
<i>but I wouldn't hear the end 
of it if Char found out.</i>

09:59.020 --> 10:00.990
<i>Well, it's not like we're in a hurry.</i>

10:00.990 --> 10:02.010
<i>Fine, then.</i>

10:02.790 --> 10:04.470
Transform!

10:05.670 --> 10:06.740
I'm off to save them.

10:06.740 --> 10:07.700
Okay.

10:07.700 --> 10:08.630
There!

10:10.750 --> 10:11.620
Ah.

10:16.130 --> 10:17.850
<i>First off, some barriers!</i>

10:23.800 --> 10:26.350
Thank goodness! Thank goodness!

10:34.740 --> 10:36.740
I'll distract the monster!

10:36.740 --> 10:38.780
All of you flee in the meantime!

10:38.780 --> 10:40.020
<i>Oh?</i>

10:38.780 --> 10:40.240
Hurry! This way!

10:40.020 --> 10:42.110
<i>Maybe she's pretty strong?</i>

10:42.110 --> 10:43.990
<i>Maybe I'm not needed here.</i>

10:53.540 --> 10:54.660
<i>Huh?!</i>

10:57.080 --> 10:58.140
Missy!

10:58.140 --> 10:58.930
Don't!

11:13.600 --> 11:15.860
Who in the world...?

11:17.500 --> 11:20.430
No, should I be thanking you first?

11:20.430 --> 11:22.940
<i>She's a bit out there.</i>

11:22.940 --> 11:25.180
That's what most people would do.

11:25.180 --> 11:26.340
Oh, good.

11:26.630 --> 11:29.710
I was almost rude to the 
person who saved my life.

11:38.830 --> 11:40.080
It doesn't hurt...

11:43.930 --> 11:46.010
My wounds are healed?

11:46.880 --> 11:49.010
Did you do this?

11:49.010 --> 11:51.390
Yeah, I couldn't bear to see you hurt.

11:52.280 --> 11:56.620
This seems different from 
ordinary healing magic, though.

11:56.620 --> 11:59.610
<i>I can't have her prying any further...</i>

11:59.610 --> 12:01.020
Missy!

12:01.920 --> 12:03.720
You're not hurt, are you?

12:03.720 --> 12:04.270
Nope.

12:04.650 --> 12:07.900
He saved me, so I'm fine.

12:10.430 --> 12:13.490
<i>Ah, he definitely thinks I'm suspicious.</i>

12:15.030 --> 12:16.600
Thank you, mister!

12:16.600 --> 12:17.430
That was amazing!

12:17.430 --> 12:19.650
You managed to beat up that huge monster!

12:23.010 --> 12:24.490
No need to thank me.

12:24.840 --> 12:28.080
I am Shiva, the enforcer of justice!

12:28.100 --> 12:30.810
<b>Silence...</b>

12:31.810 --> 12:34.470
Wow! So awesome!

12:33.630 --> 12:36.070
<i>The kid liked it, so I'll call it a win!</i>

12:42.800 --> 12:44.630
Incredible.

12:44.630 --> 12:47.050
You can do just about anything.

12:47.050 --> 12:49.000
By the way, this is a cargo wagon, right?

12:49.390 --> 12:51.370
Why were you riding it?

12:51.370 --> 12:54.010
Oh, it's actually a stagecoach.

12:54.010 --> 12:55.610
Huh? Really?!

12:55.610 --> 12:57.330
Pretty shabby-looking...

12:57.680 --> 13:01.980
Even people without a lot of 
money, like me, can ride it.

13:01.980 --> 13:03.540
I'm quite grateful.

13:03.540 --> 13:08.120
And, well, you're probably 
expecting a monetary reward...

13:08.120 --> 13:09.260
I'm sorry.

13:09.260 --> 13:11.260
Oh, pay it no mind.

13:11.260 --> 13:13.550
A hero of justice expects no reward.

13:13.830 --> 13:16.430
No, I'll pay you the next chance I get!

13:16.430 --> 13:17.470
S-Sure.

13:18.360 --> 13:21.350
Well, my work here is 
done, so I'll be going.

13:21.350 --> 13:24.460
I need to return that monster to its herd.

13:24.850 --> 13:26.980
You really are amazing.

13:27.380 --> 13:29.790
Showing mercy even to monsters...

13:32.730 --> 13:35.580
Well, it didn't do anything to me.

13:36.870 --> 13:38.330
I see.

13:39.490 --> 13:43.570
If only more people could 
think the way you do.

13:46.390 --> 13:48.130
Will we ever meet again?

13:48.130 --> 13:49.350
Who can say?

14:05.070 --> 14:07.860
Liza, you've been frowning this whole time.

14:07.860 --> 14:08.520
What's wrong?

14:09.350 --> 14:11.790
The woman earlier...

14:11.790 --> 14:13.620
She felt a little strange.

14:13.620 --> 14:15.000
Strange how?

14:16.160 --> 14:19.080
I don't know how to put 
it, other than "strange."

14:19.080 --> 14:21.810
I might know why if I'd been a bit closer.

14:21.810 --> 14:23.170
Huh...

14:23.720 --> 14:27.320
<i>Well, I'm not planning on staying 
in the capital for long,</i>

14:27.320 --> 14:29.530
<i>so I'd rather not get involved with anyone.</i>

14:33.600 --> 14:34.970
<b>Am I Actually the Strongest?</b>

14:39.840 --> 14:41.400
What a crowd!

14:41.400 --> 14:42.140
Yeah.

14:42.610 --> 14:45.490
New students, please line up here.

14:45.490 --> 14:46.170
<i>Eh?!</i>

14:46.170 --> 14:48.000
<i>I have to line up there?</i>

14:52.120 --> 14:54.790
<b>Ehehe</b>

14:53.450 --> 14:54.790
<b>Ahaha</b>

14:55.820 --> 14:58.290
<i>I-I wanna go home!</i>

15:16.590 --> 15:18.650
W-Wow!

15:19.500 --> 15:22.350
Oh, they have a room for 
your attendant, as well.

15:22.350 --> 15:23.590
Lord Haruto, look!

15:23.990 --> 15:25.580
Sorry, Liza.

15:25.580 --> 15:27.310
Let's go back for now.

15:27.310 --> 15:29.230
I can't relax in here at all.

15:35.240 --> 15:37.780
Welcome back, Haruto!

15:37.780 --> 15:40.090
Lord Haruto! We've been waiting for you!

15:40.090 --> 15:42.100
How was the royal capital?

15:42.610 --> 15:44.560
Oh, well...

15:44.560 --> 15:46.700
It was seriously exhausting...

15:49.520 --> 15:51.890
<i>Nothing beats home sweet home!</i>

15:51.890 --> 15:53.520
I'm starving.

15:53.520 --> 15:55.330
Flay, make something.

15:55.330 --> 15:56.560
Leave it to me!

15:56.560 --> 15:59.270
Why don't we eat at a 
restaurant in the capital?

15:59.500 --> 16:01.930
Well, you know...

16:01.930 --> 16:03.760
Th-That's right!

16:03.760 --> 16:05.380
We don't need to eat out!

16:05.380 --> 16:08.660
I'll put everything I have into
 making Lord Haruto a meal!

16:08.660 --> 16:10.540
Flay, can I speak with you?

16:11.190 --> 16:12.820
Whisper, whisper...

16:12.030 --> 16:15.870
<b>Whisper whisper</b>

16:12.740 --> 16:14.200
<b>Grr...</b>

16:12.820 --> 16:15.920
Whisper, whisper...

16:13.540 --> 16:15.070
Grr...

16:15.660 --> 16:16.570
<b>Hmm...</b>

16:15.990 --> 16:16.570
<b>Hmmm...</b>

16:17.050 --> 16:18.720
I see!

16:18.720 --> 16:21.890
Lord Haruto, eating out isn't 
so bad every once in a while!

16:21.890 --> 16:23.680
I'll be joining you, as well!

16:23.680 --> 16:24.890
<i>That's amazing.</i>

16:24.890 --> 16:27.220
<i>Char's got Flay eating out 
of the palm of her hand!</i>

16:27.740 --> 16:30.160
Okay, let's start preparing right away.

16:30.160 --> 16:31.390
<i>Preparing?</i>

16:34.670 --> 16:36.310
What the...

16:36.310 --> 16:39.290
I dressed Flay in cosplay so people 
don't find out she's a demon!

16:39.290 --> 16:40.940
No, they'll know for sure.

16:41.360 --> 16:42.800
<i>Fine, then.</i>

16:44.950 --> 16:47.480
Like with Liza, I just made them invisible.

16:47.480 --> 16:50.910
Your ears and tail are still 
there, so be careful.

16:52.490 --> 16:54.180
That really helps!

16:54.180 --> 16:57.120
My crotch was feeling 
awfully itchy like that.

16:58.240 --> 17:00.160
Okay, off we go!

17:08.050 --> 17:10.520
Liza, look at this!

17:10.520 --> 17:12.380
There are so many shops!

17:12.780 --> 17:14.980
Yeah, it's something else.

17:15.180 --> 17:19.420
Huh, I didn't think the castle town 
would be bustling with life like this.

17:19.420 --> 17:21.000
Haruto!

17:21.000 --> 17:23.090
Let's go in that restaurant!

17:27.290 --> 17:28.550
It's on your face.

17:29.060 --> 17:31.020
<b>Blessed Blessed</b>

17:37.240 --> 17:38.400
A map?

17:38.400 --> 17:40.280
To understand the geography of the capital.

17:40.670 --> 17:41.700
Why?

17:41.700 --> 17:43.280
Flay, you take the southern quarter,

17:43.280 --> 17:45.480
and Liza, the west.

17:46.170 --> 17:49.600
Haruto and I will survey 
the eastern quarter.

17:49.600 --> 17:51.860
Huh? You didn't come here to play?

17:51.860 --> 17:53.760
There's that, too, of course.

17:53.760 --> 17:56.010
This is just a contingency.

17:56.010 --> 17:58.670
The enemy has the geographical advantage.

17:59.180 --> 18:03.270
Our goal is simply to gain an 
accurate understanding of the land.

18:03.270 --> 18:05.510
Please take care not to stand 
out or make a commotion.

18:05.820 --> 18:06.980
You can count on me.

18:06.980 --> 18:08.730
<i>I can't trust her!</i>

18:09.090 --> 18:12.780
<i>Well, I'll play along with Char here.</i>

18:16.780 --> 18:19.370
Okay, Haruto, let's get going!

18:19.370 --> 18:20.620
Ah, sure.

18:22.360 --> 18:23.650
It's a date!

18:25.200 --> 18:26.770
What did you say?

18:26.770 --> 18:27.880
It's a date.

18:29.390 --> 18:30.100
A...

18:30.370 --> 18:31.860
<i>A date?!</i>

18:34.500 --> 18:35.990
<i>Hold your horses!</i>

18:34.750 --> 18:35.170
<b>Pound</b>

18:35.260 --> 18:35.680
<b>Pound</b>

18:35.760 --> 18:36.180
<b>Pound</b>

18:35.990 --> 18:38.260
<i>She probably picked it up from anime.</i>

18:36.260 --> 18:36.680
<b>Pound</b>

18:36.760 --> 18:37.180
<b>Pound</b>

18:37.260 --> 18:37.680
<b>Pound</b>

18:38.260 --> 18:38.680
<b>Pound</b>

18:38.260 --> 18:40.980
<i>I'm sure she doesn't really 
understand what it means.</i>

18:38.770 --> 18:39.190
<b>Pound</b>

18:39.270 --> 18:39.690
<b>Pound</b>

18:39.770 --> 18:40.190
<b>Pound</b>

18:40.270 --> 18:40.690
<b>Pound</b>

18:40.770 --> 18:40.970
<b>Pound</b>

18:40.980 --> 18:42.300
<i>But wait.</i>

18:42.300 --> 18:44.940
<i>Nobody looking can tell that we're siblings.</i>

18:45.220 --> 18:46.700
<i>And as for me!</i>

18:46.700 --> 18:49.220
<i>Have I ever experienced 
this in either life?!</i>

18:49.510 --> 18:50.670
<i>No, sir!</i>

18:50.670 --> 18:53.810
<i>This is my bonafide... first date!</i>

18:54.350 --> 18:55.900
Haruto?

18:56.320 --> 18:57.600
<i>Looks like I've got no choice.</i>

18:57.600 --> 18:59.480
<i>It's all for my adorable sister.</i>

18:59.480 --> 19:02.830
<i>I'll tag along with everything I've got!</i>

19:00.900 --> 19:02.830
Go, go!

19:23.230 --> 19:24.650
Welcome!

19:26.350 --> 19:27.970
Can I go take a look?

19:27.970 --> 19:28.680
Sure.

19:28.940 --> 19:31.840
Please, feel free to try them on.

19:31.840 --> 19:33.930
Thank you very much!

19:34.530 --> 19:37.700
Ah! This one is cute!

19:37.700 --> 19:40.230
<i>Yeah, but you're even cuter!</i>

19:40.280 --> 19:43.780
<b>Buying immediately
as an
overindulging
brother</b>

19:40.460 --> 19:41.880
I'll take this.

19:41.880 --> 19:42.860
Thanks!

19:44.090 --> 19:46.920
Thank you, Haruto!

19:46.920 --> 19:48.000
<i>No, thank </i>you<i>!</i>

19:48.330 --> 19:50.950
<i>The fearsome magic of dates!</i>

19:52.660 --> 19:54.250
Haruto!

19:54.250 --> 19:55.610
Over here!

19:55.610 --> 19:57.580
Watch where you're running, now!

20:00.900 --> 20:02.670
I'm so sorry!

20:02.670 --> 20:04.330
I'm sorry, too.

20:04.330 --> 20:06.210
I was in a bit of a hurry.

20:06.640 --> 20:08.120
Are you hurt?

20:08.120 --> 20:10.270
No, I'm just fine.

20:10.270 --> 20:11.080
Oh?

20:11.940 --> 20:13.170
You're...

20:14.630 --> 20:17.490
Have we ever met before?

20:17.810 --> 20:18.610
Huh?

20:19.350 --> 20:22.570
No, I don't think we've ever met.

20:22.570 --> 20:24.850
I don't remember ever 
seeing your face, either.

20:25.080 --> 20:25.820
However...

20:26.690 --> 20:30.870
I feel like I've felt the enormous 
mana emanating from you before.

20:33.120 --> 20:35.790
My mana level is a measly two.

20:35.790 --> 20:38.840
Calling it enormous just sounds like sarcasm.

20:38.840 --> 20:40.680
Huh? Is that true?

20:40.680 --> 20:43.440
Why would I make up such a shameful lie?

20:45.870 --> 20:47.120
I see.

20:47.420 --> 20:49.980
I was mistaken from my 
exhaustion after a long trip.

20:49.980 --> 20:52.520
I apologize if I offended you.

20:52.520 --> 20:55.540
More importantly, aren't you in a hurry?

20:55.540 --> 20:57.400
Oh, that's right!

20:57.400 --> 20:59.830
I'll be late to my part-time work interview.

20:59.830 --> 21:01.610
Well, then, pardon me.

21:04.300 --> 21:06.260
Okay, let's go, Char.

21:07.590 --> 21:08.290
Char?

21:08.290 --> 21:09.160
What's wrong?

21:10.270 --> 21:13.420
There was something weird about that person.

21:13.960 --> 21:16.670
It's hard to put into words,

21:16.670 --> 21:19.390
but I think she's no ordinary person.

21:20.210 --> 21:24.260
<i>Oh, yeah. Liza said the same thing about her.</i>

21:24.260 --> 21:29.090
<i>Can those with high mana levels like 
demons and Char sense something?</i>

21:29.570 --> 21:32.900
<i>Whatever it may be, I want 
to avoid any headaches,</i>

21:32.900 --> 21:34.800
<i>so from tomorrow until 
the entrance ceremony,</i>

21:34.800 --> 21:37.310
<i>I'm going to stay in my room and do nothing!</i>

23:09.030 --> 23:24.040
m 0 0 l 110 0 l 102 22 l 0 22

23:09.030 --> 23:24.040
Episode Preview

23:09.630 --> 23:11.170
Charlotte here!

23:09.990 --> 23:10.780
<b>Two...</b>

23:11.170 --> 23:13.810
Today, I went on a date with Haruto!

23:13.810 --> 23:16.970
I had so much fun with just 
the two of us, after so long!

23:16.970 --> 23:19.660
Next episode: "The Entrance 
Ceremony Hullabaloo".

23:17.540 --> 23:24.040
<b>The Entrance Ceremony Hullabaloo</b>

23:19.660 --> 23:20.750
Finally, the entrance ceremony!

23:20.750 --> 23:22.930
I can just tell something will happen!
